* [Hermes Agent](https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent?utm_source=chatgpt.com) — self-improving/skill-learning baseline. ([GitHub][9])
* [Google Budget-Aware Agent / BATS](https://github.com/google-research/budget-aware-agent?utm_source=chatgpt.com) — budget tracker + budget-aware test-time scaling. ([GitHub][10])
