cost/game
cost/win
model calls/game
escalations/game
allocation regret
illegal-action rate
combo completion rate
resource efficiency
```

Deck identity becomes:

```text
task_family
```

but do not assume one fixed optimal sequence.

Evaluation must include:

```text
known deck / known opponent
known deck / unseen opponent
variant deck
new deck within same archetype
entirely unseen archetype
```

Primary research question:

> How quickly can the lab become competent on a new decision family under a fixed cumulative intelligence budget?

