# 20. Cross-world transfer

Only after YGO produces a real learning curve.

Do not claim YGO results transfer to work merely because win rate improves.

Test transfer.

World sequence:

```text
Filesystem
Coding
Memory-dependent coding
YGO
later Roblox/artifact work
```

Evaluate whether the learned meta-policy transfers:

```text
when to retrieve
when to verify
when to escalate
when to branch
when to stop
```

NOT whether Yu-Gi-Oh card knowledge transfers.

The transferable object is resource-allocation policy.

