# 21. Harness routing comes later

Initially harness is assigned by experiment.

Do NOT allow BATS to change harness in the middle of Experiment 001.

That destroys clean attribution.

After enough evidence exists, introduce:

```python
HarnessRouter.select(
    task_features,
    worker_features,
    budget,
    hydra_priors,
) -> HarnessProfile
```

Possible output:

```text
direct-fast
pydantic-code-mode
letta-stateful
```

Hermes remains an external baseline until there is evidence that dynamic production routing to Hermes is useful.

Eventually:

```text
task arrives
    ↓
features
    ↓
Hydra historical outcomes
    ↓
router posterior
    ↓
choose harness
    ↓
execute
    ↓
outcome updates posterior
```

This is the point where Moltwork actually learns which harness is best.

